## Production Best Practices

    ```bash
    export CHATCLI_JWT_SECRET=$(openssl rand -hex 32)
    export CHATCLI_JWT_ISSUER="chatcli-production"
    export CHATCLI_JWT_AUDIENCE="chatcli-api"
    chatcli server
    ```
  
    ```bash
