| `OPENAI_API_URL` | Custom Chat Completions endpoint. Must be the **full** URL (ending in `/chat/completions`); the `/models` listing URL is derived from it. With a custom host, the model listing is not filtered by family — every model the gateway returns is listed. Requests keep sending `OPENAI_API_KEY` as the Bearer token, so set it to the gateway's key | `https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions` |
| `OPENAI_RESPONSES_API_URL` | Custom Responses API endpoint. Set it together with `OPENAI_API_URL` when redirecting the provider to a compatible endpoint | `https://api.openai.com/v1/responses` |

### Anthropic (Claude)

| Variable | Description | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | API key | -- |
| `ANTHROPIC_MODEL` | Model to use (e.g., `claude-opus-4-8`, `claude-opus-4-7`, `claude-sonnet-4-6`) | `claude-sonnet-4-6` |
| `ANTHROPIC_MAX_TOKENS` | Response token limit | `20000` |
