## Reporting bugs

Open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/diillson/chatcli/issues) with:

- ChatCLI version (`chatcli --version`)
- Operating system and Go version
- Steps to reproduce
- Expected vs observed behavior
- Relevant logs (use `LOG_LEVEL=debug`)



